ent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>那后市会怎么走？首先我们定义这波下跌只是洗盘，还会创新高。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>那现在就1个问题，是直接V型反转，还是先回调之后再涨。我们来复盘一下。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>历史上直接V型反转只有去年2月的疫情低开那一次。他是出现特别大的利空，让所有散户恐慌割肉，并且反弹后也不敢买的时候才会出现。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'><br/></span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.33712374581939797\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMMs98KMHXbVOAVv42Mb4a3oMae76fb0AWR1JibrhSmb9uibyNvFbBA93NPcVbCQfwzD3AiaAFa58jang/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1495\" style=\"\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>散户买入不是好事，散户的买单会很快变成卖压。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>而其他的底部比如19年4月，去年3月、7月、和今年3月都是震荡筑底，或反弹后二次探底。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;outline: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, SimSun, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>所以，我大概给一个概率，有80%的概率是先回调再涨，尤其是上证指数和深圳成指。回调的时候，下方缩量就是第二次进场机会。</span><br/></p></div>",
